00:58:33.500 --> 00:58:39.900
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who wanders into our workspace looking at all the new stuff we've bought and asks,
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理监督人托里·马拉蒂亚，他走进我们的工作空间，看着我们买的所有新东西，问道，

00:58:39.900 --> 00:58:46.490
<v Roger Wendlick>What-- What d-- What-- How-- What's the price?
<v Roger Wendlick>什么——什么……什么……怎么——价格是多少？

00:58:46.490 --> 00:58:50.340
